Description:
This contract has been awarded as a call off from Managed Learning Services  CCS Framework RM3822, and this notice is published  for Transparency.  As part of the Defence Cyber School required training output we are to enable the delivery of SANS 500 series courses to Defence audience working within technical cyber roles in support of the UK National Cyber Security Strategy.
The requirement is to deliver:
1 x 6 day SANS SEC504 course to 25 delegates;
1 x 6 day SANS SEC508 course to 25 delegates; 
1 x 6 day SANS SEC511 course to 25 delegates; ;
1 x 6 day SANS SEC503 course to 25 delegates; all four courses to be delivered by 07 March 2022
